{
 "info": {
  "name": "Kedem Life API",
  "description": "Every route of the Kedem Life REST API (server/openapi.json is the reference). Set {{baseUrl}} to the API root (default http://localhost:4000/api), run Auth > Login, then call anything: protected requests send Bearer {{token}} from the collection auth. Demo password for every seed account: kedemlife.",
